      "comment": "DOONGALLA PARODY (1) has been in super consistent form, finishing in the minors at her last eight runs. Last time finished 3rd on October 3 over 525m at this track behind Saint Bernardo beaten 4.5 lengths (30.36) in a Restricted WIN. Still to record a win from this draw but has never missed the frame in four starts. Deserves a win and gets her chance. WAH ELM (5) scored a most impressive win two back then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 5 length 5th at Sandown (29.99). The form out of her last race has been franked. Bold showing expected. IRISH ZOE (7) finds it hard to break through. Finished third (25.65) at Ballarat latest and might be close to finding winning form again. Form from her last run is proving to be solid. Leading player again. FULL BORE BUSTER (4) is another with top-three prospects.",
